# Stormpike Battle Charger for Exalted Stormpike Guard (Era rule; the reputation
# comes from Alterac Valley, one of Forever's four battlegrounds).
# Sources: Forever client 1.60.1.70532 via wago.tools (ItemSparse: level 60,
# 200g, no reputation on the item; MountCapability: Riding 150 and no kind's
# riding, so any race of the side rides it once it has Journeyman Riding);
# items.json / npcs.json for the vendors.
# ASSUMED: the vendor sells it at Exalted (Classic rule; the client item has no
# standing, but its PlayerCondition 3887 "Requires Stormpike Guard - Exalted" is there for
# a vendor row). In-game check: the vendor's list below Exalted.

step Stormpike Guard
  tip Alterac Valley (level 51+) raises Stormpike Guard: win, capture towers and graveyards, and hand in the battleground's turn-ins; the Alterac Valley Reputation guide shows the fastest way. Thanthaldis Snowgleam waits outside the battleground on the Alterac Mountains border above Hillsbrad; Gaelden Hammersmith inside Alterac Valley sells the same mount.
  rep "Stormpike Guard" Exalted

step Stormpike Battle Charger
  tip The Forever client lists it at 200g and level 60. It runs at full speed, so riding it needs Journeyman Riding; any Alliance race can ride it.
  level 60
  skill Riding 150
  buy 19030 npc 13217                 -- Thanthaldis Snowgleam, 200g
